I just want to pause to give a definition.

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:05.740
Does anyone have a definition
that they'd like to share?

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:09.130
With us of what they think
behavioral economics is.

00:16:14.841 --> 00:16:19.163
Crickets, I once did something to someone,
