&gt;&gt; Interesting, so
you're saying, get them-

00:36:16.400 --> 00:36:17.943
&gt;&gt; So if they're like,

00:36:17.943 --> 00:36:20.958
I still need ten hours
left to make my cut.

00:36:20.958 --> 00:36:21.700
&gt;&gt; Yep.

00:36:21.700 --> 00:36:24.413
&gt;&gt; That ten hours, you better make it.

00:36:24.413 --> 00:36:26.850
&gt;&gt; I like this, because this is
actually how people think, so

00:36:26.850 --> 00:36:29.210
