00:37:09.370 --> 00:37:10.430
&gt;&gt; Yes, you're correct here.

00:37:10.430 --> 00:37:11.620
This is called prospect theory.

00:37:11.620 --> 00:37:16.240
And they do dislike losing
more than they like gaining.

00:37:16.240 --> 00:37:20.590
And so, all the conditions worked,
